; ==============================================================================
; DNS-AID (DNS for AI Discovery) Zone Records for paceinsights.com
; Ref: IETF draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid / RFC 9460
; ==============================================================================
; Copy and import these records into your DNS provider's zone file (e.g., Netlify DNS, Cloudflare, Route 53, or Namecheap)
; Make sure your DNS zone is signed with DNSSEC so resolvers return authenticated data.

; 1. Agent connection SVCB (Service Binding) Record
; Specifies endpoint connection parameters (ALPN, port) for agent-to-agent interactions
_a2a._agents.paceinsights.com.      3600  IN  SVCB    1 paceinsights.com. alpn="a2a" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port

; 2. Agent index discovery TXT Record
; Lists active agent endpoints and their protocol interfaces available under the domain
_index._agents.paceinsights.com.    3600  IN  TXT     "agents=chat:mcp,billing:a2a,support:https"
